  "n": 37,
  "title": "When AI Gives an Answer, Why Do We Stop Asking Questions?",
  "cat": "Technology & AI",
  "framework": "Suggestion → Reduced Friction → Trust → Reduced Verification → Feedback",
  "idea": "AI can reduce the cost of producing an answer, but good judgment still requires deciding when an answer deserves trust and when it needs verification."
