  "title": "When AI Makes Work Faster, Why Can Work Still Feel Busier?",
  "cat": "Technology & AI",
  "framework": "Lower Task Cost → More Tasks Become Worth Doing → Output Expectations Rise → Coordination & Review Expand → Bottleneck Shifts",
