  "title": "Why the Best Customers Are Not Always the Most Profitable",
  "cat": "Business",
  "framework": "Revenue → Gross Margin → Cost-to-Serve → Retention → Lifetime Economics → Strategic Spillovers",
  "idea": "Customer value cannot be judged from revenue alone: profitability depends on margins, service costs, retention, acquisition costs, and strategic spillovers over time."
